        "Pas de convergence uniforme.",
        "$\\int_0^1 f_n = [-\\frac{1}{2}e^{-nx^2}]_0^1 = \\frac{1}{2}(1 - e^{-n}) \\to \\frac{1}{2} \\neq 0$."
