        "$= -\\ln(1-x) - \\frac{1}{x}(-\\ln(1-x) - x) = -\\ln(1-x) + \\frac{\\ln(1-x)}{x} + 1$",
        "$= 1 + (\\frac{1}{x} - 1)\\ln(1-x)$."
      ],
      "lecons": [243],
      "tags": ["séries entières", "somme"]
